{"seq":28,"slug":"real-estate-investing","title":"房地产投资","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing","rating":{"composite":3.96,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 房地产投资\n\n房地产投资是一个将金融资本配置到不动产领域以获取收益的系统性学科。与股票、债券等金融资产不同，房地产投资涉及物理空间的选择、运营管理、政策博弈和周期判断，其复杂度远超单纯的资产买卖。2026 年全球房地产交易额回升至约 8730 亿美元，中国公募 REITs 总市值突破 2450 亿元人民币——这些数字背后，是一整套从估值分析到运营管理的知识体系在驱动决策。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于房地产作为**投资品类**的分析框架与实操方法论。它与同类 hub 的分工如下：\n\n- **个人理财**（`05_personal-finance`）覆盖购房决策作为家庭资产配置的一环，侧重「该不该买房」的财务规划视角\n- **公司金融**（`10_corporate-finance`）处理房企的资本结构与估值，侧重企业融资与并购\n- **投资基础**（`11_investment-fundamentals`）提供通用投资理论（MPT、EMH、风险计量），本 hub 将这些理论应用于不动产领域\n\n本 hub 则深入房地产投资本身的内在逻辑：从物业类型与收益结构出发，经由估值模型和市场分析，进入投资策略选择，最终落到 2026 年全球实践中的真实案例与前沿趋势。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n**路径 A（系统学习）：** 按章节顺序从基础 → 分析 → 策略 → 实践逐步推进。适合对房地产投资尚无体系认知的读者。\n\n**路径 B（目标驱动）：** 已有投资经验的读者可直接进入感兴趣的策略章节（REITs、商业地产、PropTech），遇到概念空缺时回溯基础章节补充。\n\n**路径 C（研究导向）：** 关注宏观趋势和前沿的读者可从第四章「实践前沿」入手，结合第二章的分析方法进行验证。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基本的财务报表阅读能力（参见 `10_corporate-finance` 财务分析章节）\n- 货币时间价值、折现现金流的基本概念（参见 `11_investment-fundamentals` 投资基础章节）\n- 对宏观经济周期（利率、通胀、GDP）有初步认知\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"房地产投资基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"investment-characteristics","title":"不动产作为投资品的独特属性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/foundations/investment-characteristics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"property-types","title":"物业类型与收益风险图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/foundations/property-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"return-metrics","title":"房地产投资回报指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/foundations/return-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"analysis","title":"房地产估值与市场分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"valuation-methods","title":"房地产估值三大方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/analysis/valuation-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-cycles","title":"房地产市场周期与宏观分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/analysis/market-cycles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"due-diligence","title":"房地产投资尽职调查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/analysis/due-diligence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategies","title":"房地产投资策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reits-investing","title":"REITs 投资：从公募基金到全球配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/strategies/reits-investing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commercial-strategies","title":"商业地产投资策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/strategies/commercial-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"residential-leverage","title":"住宅投资与杠杆管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/strategies/residential-leverage"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"房地产投资实践前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"proptech-digital","title":"PropTech 与房地产数字化转型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/practice/proptech-digital"},{"seq":2,"slug":"esg-green-building","title":"ESG 与绿色建筑投资","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/practice/esg-green-building"},{"seq":3,"slug":"china-market-transformation","title":"中国房地产市场转型与投资机遇","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/practice/china-market-transformation"}]}]}